{"study_accession":"PRJNA637768","secondary_study_accession":"SRP266242","title":"C9orf72 in myeloid cells suppresses STING-induced inflammation","description":"In this study we report that loss of C9orf72 expression in myeloid cells drives STING/type I interferon mediated autoimmunity and enhanced tumor immunity in mice. Additionally, we show that the immunophenotypic signature identified in C9orf72-/- mice is present in blood derived macrophages, whole blood and autopsy brain tissue from C9orf72 repeat expansion ALS/FTD patients. Overall design: DCs: 4 WT & 4 C9orf72 KO; Bcells, CD4, CD8 & CD11B: 4 WT, 4 Cx3Cr1-CRE conditional C9orf72 KO, 3 C9orf72 KO & 4 C9orf72 KO x Golden Ticket (Tmem173 KO); hMDMs: 5 Normal Controls, 5 with C9ORF72 expansion & 5 Sporadic ALS; hMDMs_H151: 2 C9ORF72 expansion samples treated with H151 & the same 2 C9ORF72 expansion samples treated with DMSO","pubmed":"32814898","geo_series":"","n_samples":4,"study_labels":[],"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN15286885","study_accession":"PRJNA637768","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"MDM_C9ALS_6_DMSO","description":"MDM_C9ALS_6_DMSO","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM4622568","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2020-09-04","attributes":[["source_name","Monocyte-derived macrophages"],["strain","not applicable"],["genotype","Positive for C9orf72 repeat expansion"],["age at collection","49 Years"],["age of onset","missing"],["days in culture","7"],["total rna input","103.2 ng"],["cell_type","Peripheral blood mononuclear cells (PBMCs)"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR12030576","experiment_accession":"SRX8561914","library_layout":"SINGLE","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"NextSeq 500","read_count":38275380,"base_count":2890868148,"first_public":"2020-09-04","experiment_title":"NextSeq 500 sequencing: GSM4622568: MDM_C9ALS_6_DMSO Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN15286886","study_accession":"PRJNA637768","blood_cl